msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You won’t have the energy to do anything if you don’t keep yourself well rested "
"and nourished."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫不好好休息、⟪k:3⟫好好吃饭的话，⟪k:4⟫身体会撑不住的。"

