#: scenario8:scenario8_781D2988_007B_4129_8E5B_D73C73D5793B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c637c8fa9f90f02a77c042d018ac0775a4e0fa4a816a1b29a5c5cdc2e9437eed
